{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295430/extras/76dec3dd85dd8eb3cdfd66f87a100c2f.poster.avif?t=1772907195\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295430/extras/76dec3dd85dd8eb3cdfd66f87a100c2f.webm?t=1772907195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295430/extras/76dec3dd85dd8eb3cdfd66f87a100c2f.mp4?t=1772907195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Type Ride&quot;</strong> is a typing-based tower defense game where you summon units by typing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, once known as the &quot;Type Rider&quot; for her high-speed typing skills while riding a motorcycle, has been tasked with resolving issues in a world overrun by ink lifeforms. She decides to ride her beloved bike once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295430/extras/dcf44c8e36acf9176e8303f35e96fac3.poster.avif?t=1772907195\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295430/extras/dcf44c8e36acf9176e8303f35e96fac3.webm?t=1772907195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295430/extras/dcf44c8e36acf9176e8303f35e96fac3.mp4?t=1772907195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Unique Deck</strong>: Construct your own deck with over 50 unique ink monsters, each possessing various elements such as attributes, classes, and special skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Typing Summons</strong>: A system where you summon ink monsters by successfully typing. Counter the approaching ink lifeforms by summoning your own creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Battles</strong>: Use the order of summoning and spell cards strategically to gain an advantage in battle.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3295430?t=1772907195","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3295430?t=1772907195","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295430/68979c8c248af62ac20d1b1c18584cf03a370b2a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772907195","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295430/68979c8c248af62ac20d1b1c18584cf03a370b2a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772907195","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4035550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295430/extras/76dec3dd85dd8eb3cdfd66f87a100c2f.poster.avif?t=1772907195\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295430/extras/76dec3dd85dd8eb3cdfd66f87a100c2f.webm?t=1772907195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295430/extras/76dec3dd85dd8eb3cdfd66f87a100c2f.mp4?t=1772907195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Type Ride&quot;</strong> is a typing-based tower defense game where you summon units by typing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, once known as 